{"step_index":116,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-07T06:34:03Z","input_tokens":5212,"cache_read_tokens":57511,"output_tokens":902,"thinking":"Reviewing the requirements for `NoteList.jsx`, the core logic involves fetching and displaying notes from an API. The notes need to be rendered using the `map()` function after storing the API response in the state. Each list item requires a unique key, and clicking on a title should fetch the detailed note.\n\nAdditional features include handling the empty state (no notes), a refresh button to update the note list, and a \"new note\" button. Furthermore, it's necessary to display a badge related to \"심화 3 처리 상태\".\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import React from 'react';\n\nexport default function NoteList({\n  notes,\n  selectedId,\n  onSelectNote,\n  onOpenCreate,\n  onRefresh,\n  loading,\n  error,\n}) {\n  const getStatusBadgeClass = (status) => {\n    switch (status) {\n      case '완료':\n        return 'badge badge-success';\n      case '확인 중':\n        return 'badge badge-warning';\n      default:\n        return 'badge badge-secondary';\n    }\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"card note-list-card\">\n      <div className=\"card-header list-header\">\n        <div className=\"list-header-left\">\n          <h3>📝 관찰 메모 목록</h3>\n          <span className=\"count-badge\">{notes.length}건</span>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"list-header-actions\">\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            className=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\"\n            onClick={onRefresh}\n            disabled={loading}\n            title=\"메모 목록 새로고침\"\n          >\n            🔄 새로고침\n          </button>\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            className=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\"\n            onClick={onOpenCreate}\n          >\n            ➕ 새 메모 작성\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div className=\"card-body no-padding\">\n        {error && (\n          <div className=\"alert alert-error m-3\">\n            <span>{error}</span>\n          </div>\n        )}\n\n        {loading ? (\n          <div className=\"loading-box\">메모 목록을 불러오는 중...</div>\n        ) : notes.length === 0 ? (\n          <div className=\"empty-box\">\n            <p>작성된 관찰 메모가 없습니다.</p>\n            <p className=\"empty-sub\">상단의 \"➕ 새 메모 작성\" 버튼을 눌러 첫 관찰 메모를 작성해 보세요.</p>\n          </div>\n        ) : (\n          <ul className=\"note-list\">\n            {notes.map((note) => (\n              <li\n                key={note.id}\n                className={`note-item ${selectedId === note.id ? 'active' : ''}`}\n                onClick={() => onSelectNote(note.id)}\n              >\n                <div className=\"note-item-left\">\n                  <span className=\"note-id\">#{note.id}</span>\n                  <button\n                    type=\"button\"\n                    className=\"note-title-btn\"\n                    onClick={(e) => {\n                      e.stopPropagation();\n                      onSelectNote(note.id);\n                    }}\n                  >\n                    {note.title}\n                  </button>\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"note-item-right\">\n                  <span className={getStatusBadgeClass(note.status)}>\n                    {note.status || '확인 전'}\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n            ))}\n          </ul>\n        )}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n","Description":"Create src/components/NoteList.jsx","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"c:\\work\\mini-watch-day03-start\\monitor\\frontend\\src\\components\\NoteList.jsx","toolAction":"Creating NoteList.jsx","toolSummary":"Create NoteList component"}}]}
