{"step_index":134,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-07T07:00:05Z","input_tokens":76761,"cache_read_tokens":0,"output_tokens":2637,"thinking":"The successful build suggests the project's foundational structure is sound. Proceeding with a checklist verification is essential to ensure all required functionalities are present. First, confirm the Flask backend and React frontend are operational and connected through the API. Secondly, verify the PostgreSQL connection with psycopg, specifically that parameter binding is correctly implemented in SQL queries.\n\n\nNow focusing on core functionalities: React will manage login input via state, transmitting the data to the Flask API. Flask must then authenticate the credentials against the database using password hashing, determining success or failure. Upon successful login, the application will display the dashboard; logout will return the user to the login screen.\n\n\nVerifying the core setup and deployment steps by providing environment configuration examples and comprehensive installation instructions, including database setup. Confirmed completion of all core and advanced features: request logging with filtering, aggregate request summaries, observation notes with status updates, and session-based authentication. Now, transitioning into integrated scenario testing based on the provided PDF, beginning with general browsing and login verification.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"..\\..\\venv\\Scripts\\python -c \"\nimport requests\n\n# 백엔드 서버 라우팅 및 DB 연동 종합 검증\nfrom app import app\nclient = app.test_client()\n\nprint('=== 1. 인증 테스트 ===')\n# 빈 입력 -> 400\nr = client.post('/api/auth/login', json={'username': '  ', 'password': ' '})\nassert r.status_code == 400, f'Expected 400, got {r.status_code}'\n\n# 틀린 비밀번호 -> 401\nr = client.post('/api/auth/login', json={'username': 'admin', 'password': 'wrongpassword'})\nassert r.status_code == 401, f'Expected 401, got {r.status_code}'\n\n# 올바른 로그인 -> 200\nr = client.post('/api/auth/login', json={'username': 'admin', 'password': 'Learn123!'})\nassert r.status_code == 200, f'Expected 200, got {r.status_code}'\nassert r.get_json()['user']['username'] == 'admin'\n\nprint('=== 2. 비인증 보호 테스트 ===')\nunauth = app.test_client()\nassert unauth.get('/api/events').status_code == 401\nassert unauth.get('/api/notes').status_code == 401\nassert unauth.post('/api/notes', json={'title':'a','content':'b'}).status_code == 401\n\nprint('=== 3. 요청 기록 수집 및 조회/필터/요약 테스트 ===')\n# 일반 서비스로부터의 이벤트 수신 (POST /api/events)\nr = client.post('/api/events', json={'method': 'GET', 'path': '/posts/1', 'status_code': 200})\nassert r.status_code == 201\nr = client.post('/api/events', json={'method': 'GET', 'path': '/posts/999', 'status_code': 404})\nassert r.status_code == 201\n\n# 로그인된 세션으로 조회\nr = client.get('/api/events')\nassert r.status_code == 200\nevents = r.get_json()['events']\nsummary = r.get_json()['summary']\nassert len(events) >= 2\nassert summary['total_count'] >= 2\nassert summary['error_count'] >= 1\nprint(f'Events count: {len(events)}, Total: {summary[\\\"total_count\\\"]}, Errors: {summary[\\\"error_count\\\"]}')\n\n# 필터링 테스트\nr = client.get('/api/events?status_code=404')\nassert r.status_code == 200\nassert all(e['status_code'] == 404 for e in r.get_json()['events'])\n\nprint('=== 4. 메모 CRUD 및 유효성 검사 테스트 ===')\n# 빈 제목 작성 시도 -> 400\nr = client.post('/api/notes', json={'title': '   ', 'content': '내용'})\nassert r.status_code == 400\n\n# 빈 내용 작성 시도 -> 400\nr = client.post('/api/notes', json={'title': '제목', 'content': '   '})\nassert r.status_code == 400\n\n# 정상 작성 -> 201\nr = client.post('/api/notes', json={'title': '없는 게시글 요청 확인', 'content': '요청 경로와 404 응답을 확인했다.', 'status': '확인 전'})\nassert r.status_code == 201\nnote1 = r.get_json()['note']\nnote1_id = note1['id']\nassert note1['title'] == '없는 게시글 요청 확인'\nassert note1['status'] == '확인 전'\n\n# 상세 조회 -> 200\nr = client.get(f'/api/notes/{note1_id}')\nassert r.status_code == 200\nassert r.get_json()['note']['id'] == note1_id\n\n# 공백으로 수정 시도 -> 400 및 기존 내용 보존 확인\nr = client.put(f'/api/notes/{note1_id}', json={'title': ' ', 'content': '  '})\nassert r.status_code == 400\nr = client.get(f'/api/notes/{note1_id}')\nassert r.get_json()['note']['title'] == '없는 게시글 요청 확인'\n\n# 정상 수정 -> 200\nr = client.put(f'/api/notes/{note1_id}', json={'title': '없는 게시글 조치 완료', 'content': '해당 경로 확인 완료', 'status': '완료'})\nassert r.status_code == 200\nassert r.get_json()['note']['title'] == '없는 게시글 조치 완료'\nassert r.get_json()['note']['status'] == '완료'\n\n# 삭제용 테스트 메모 생성\nr = client.post('/api/notes', json={'title': '삭제 테스트 메모', 'content': '삭제할 내용'})\nassert r.status_code == 201\ndel_id = r.get_json()['note']['id']\n\n# 삭제 -> 200\nr = client.delete(f'/api/notes/{del_id}')\nassert r.status_code == 200\n\n# 다시 조회/수정/삭제 시도 -> 모두 404\nassert client.get(f'/api/notes/{del_id}').status_code == 404\nassert client.put(f'/api/notes/{del_id}', json={'title':'a','content':'b'}).status_code == 404\nassert client.delete(f'/api/notes/{del_id}').status_code == 404\n\nprint('=== 5. 로그아웃 테스트 ===')\nr = client.post('/api/auth/logout')\nassert r.status_code == 200\nr = client.get('/api/auth/me')\nassert r.get_json()['user'] is None\nassert client.get('/api/notes').status_code == 401\n\nprint('모든 통합 검증 시나리오가 성공적으로 통과되었습니다! ✨')\n\"","Cwd":"c:\\work\\mini-watch-day03-start\\monitor\\backend","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Running integration tests","toolSummary":"Run integration test suite"}}]}
